     "blokeak": [
      {
       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "Sean <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> la hélice circular y <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math> el campo escalar. Calculemos <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></math>. <math display=\"block\"><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>σ</mi></msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">∥</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>−</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">∥</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>⋯</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0\"></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>"
      }
     ]
