       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "Sean <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">ℝ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math> y <span class=\"j-mat-luzea\"><math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>y</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></math></span>. Queremos calcular <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi>σ</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></math>."
